---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Head from '../../components/Head.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <Head title="Kids Story Generator — Praweg Koirala" description="Agentic AI pipeline that generates illustrated children's stories from simple prompts using Python, ADK, and Gemini." ogType="article" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <article class="content-container prose project-detail">
        <header class="project-header">
          <h1>Kids Story Generator</h1>
          <p class="project-subtitle">Agentic AI pipeline that generates illustrated children's stories from simple prompts using Python, ADK, and Gemini.</p>
          <div class="tags-row">
            <span class="tag">Python</span>
            <span class="tag">ADK</span>
            <span class="tag">Gemini</span>
            <span class="tag">AI Agents</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/koirpraw" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source &nearr;</a>
          </div>
        </header>

        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>The Kids Story Generator is an agentic AI pipeline that transforms simple prompts into fully-illustrated children's stories. It uses Google's Agent Development Kit (ADK) to orchestrate multiple specialized agents:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Story Weaver</strong> — Generates narrative arcs, characters, and plot</li>
          <li><strong>Illustration Engine</strong> — Creates scene descriptions and prompts for image generation</li>
          <li><strong>Formatting Agent</strong> — Composes the final output with proper layout and styling</li>
          <li><strong>Review Agent</strong> — Ensures age-appropriate content and narrative coherence</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Architecture</h3>
        <pre><code>User Prompt
    |
    v
[Story Weaver] ---- generates narrative ----> [Review Agent]
    |                                                |
    v                                                v
[Illustration Engine]                       Feedback Loop
    |
    v
[Formatting Agent]
    |
    v
Final Story (MDX + Images)</code></pre>

        <h3>Technical Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Framework:</strong> Google ADK (Agent Development Kit)</li>
          <li><strong>LLM:</strong> Gemini 2.5 Pro (primary), Gemini 2.5 Flash (review agent)</li>
          <li><strong>Image Gen:</strong> Gemini-native image generation</li>
          <li><strong>Format:</strong> MDX output with embedded illustrations</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Status</h3>
        <p>Active development. Pipeline prototype is functional; working on UI layer and story preset system.</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<script>
(function() {
  const html = document.documentElement;
  const stored = localStorage.getItem('theme');
  if (stored === 'light' || stored === 'dark') {
    html.setAttribute('data-theme', stored);
  }
})();
</script>

<style>
  .project-header { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .project-header h1 { font-size: var(--font-size-3xl); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .project-subtitle { font-size: var(--font-size-lg); color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-top: var(--space-sm); }
  .tags-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-xs); margin-top: var(--space-sm); }
  .project-links { display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); margin-top: var(--space-lg); }
</style>